# Static build arguments for tool/deploy/web/Dockerfile.
#
# The web image is built once and serves staging, production and self-hosted;
# the environment is chosen by the container runtime, so nothing else may be
# baked in at build time. `RELEASE_SHA` is deliberately absent: the builder
# resolves it from the commit being deployed so the image identity always
# matches the runtime `POMODOIST_RELEASE`.
#
# tool/deploy/web/check_build_contract.py fails when these values, the
# Dockerfile ARG list, server/compose.yaml or any build site drifts apart.
POMODOIST_BILLING_CHANNEL=stripe
